"apps.title" = "My apps and daily time";
"apps.scope" = "Choose apps, categories or websites through Apple's private picker, then choose always block, a shared daily budget or a daily quiet-hours window. It is not a whole-phone lock; keep essential apps accessible.";
"apps.browserGuardGuidance" = "Safari rules do not protect every browser. To shield browsers or mixed-content apps such as X, use Choose apps and websites, select every browser app you want blocked, choose Always block, then apply the rule. This is a separate Screen Time choice, not an extension or profile scan. During a commitment, Hisn will not let you change that saved rule.";
"apps.browserGuardLimits" = "iPhone and iPad cannot require this Mac browser extension or continuously watch extension presence, close other browsers, or offer the Mac one-minute repair countdown. Applied Screen Time shields do not need Hisn to stay open: iOS manages them while authorization remains approved. Safari and family DNS are separate layers; none scans all content in other apps. Personal adult authorization can be revoked and Hisn can be deleted.";
