"commitment.confirmBody %lld" = "You choose %lld days without early self-release inside Hisn. This does not make Hisn undeletable or stop revocation in Apple settings. Keep access to essential services. Protection depends on separately enabled layers.";
"commitment.scope" = "A voluntary app-level lock, not a device-owner lock. Device erasure, removal and permission revocation can bypass it; moving the clock cannot end it early. While it runs, saved rule lists are frozen (blocked sites and app limits). Protection layers can still be added or restored, but not turned off. DNS and Safari stay enabled independently; ending a plan does not automatically turn them off.";
