"browserfirst.title" = "Safari extension setup";
"browserfirst.body" = "Hisn Text is a separate Safari extension that checks changing webpage text on this device. Detected X/Twitter posts are hidden individually without adding the whole service to your blocked sites. Other websites use page-level checking.";
"browserfirst.unverified" = "Text-scanner access is not verified here";
"browserfirst.steps" = "In Safari's extension settings, enable Hisn Text and allow website access for each site you want checked. This is separate from the Hisn 1–6 domain blockers. Reload existing tabs after enabling it; check profiles and private browsing separately. Merely installing Hisn does not enable the scanner.";
"browserfirst.appOnly" = "If you choose to move a mixed-content service to Safari, select only its native app below and choose Always block. Do not select its website or an overlapping category if you want to keep the website available. Not every app has an equivalent website.";
"browserfirst.limits" = "The scanner cannot inspect other apps. Optional local visual checks sample accessible images/video frames; face blurring is separate, experimental, and can miss people. Unreadable media is unknown, not safe, and content may appear before a verdict. Physical-device visual support is not yet verified. Website permission, extension removal and OS authorization remain separate limits. Intentional site blocks and other protection rules still apply.";
"browserfirst.quickTitle" = "Your browser extension";
"browserfirst.quickBody" = "Website text and optional visual checks are managed separately in Hisn Text for Safari.";
"browserfirst.openSetup" = "Review Safari extension setup";
"browserfirst.enable.title" = "Enable Hisn Text";
"browserfirst.enable.body" = "Open Safari’s extension settings and turn on Hisn Text. The Hisn 1–6 domain blockers are separate layers.";
"browserfirst.access.title" = "Allow website access";
"browserfirst.access.body" = "Allow Hisn Text on the sites you want checked, then reload open tabs. Check Safari profiles and private browsing separately; installing the app alone does not grant access.";
"browserfirst.visual.title" = "Visual checks";
"browserfirst.visual.body" = "Open Hisn Text’s extension settings. In Protection layers, configure Adult-media checks and Person blur separately. Choose Off, Women, Men or All people for person blur.";
"browserfirst.visual.appearance" = "Person blur uses detected faces. Women and men are appearance estimates, not identity or an adult-content judgment. The estimate can be wrong and people can be missed.";
"browserfirst.visual.unverified" = "Visual settings belong to Safari; this app does not verify them. Physical-device visual detection is not yet verified. Only accessible images and sampled video frames can be checked.";
"browserfirst.details" = "How Hisn Text works and its limits";
"safari.parts.details" = "Review all six domain blockers";
"removal.setup.title" = "Set up removal protection";
"removal.setup.mobile" = "On iPhone and iPad, Chrome management policies do not protect Hisn. A parent can restrict app deletion using Screen Time. Individual self-control authorization does not prevent deletion. This app cannot verify every manual Screen Time restriction; follow the Apple guide and test the settings with your guardian. Keep recovery access available.";
